## Developers

Connect Tolstoy to AI agents and assistants through MCP (Model Context Protocol). Full documentation: https://developers.gotolstoy.com

- [Developer hub](https://developers.gotolstoy.com/welcome): MCP and integration documentation for Tolstoy.
- [OpenAPI spec](https://www.gotolstoy.com/openapi.json): machine-readable description of the workspace API — operations, request and response schemas, and OAuth 2.0 authentication (scope `workspace`).
- MCP server (Model Context Protocol, Streamable HTTP transport): connect a client to `https://apilb.gotolstoy.com/mcp/v1/mcp` (workspace tools, OAuth sign-in). Client setup guides: https://www.gotolstoy.com/mcp
- CLI: [`@tolstoy-ai/cli`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@tolstoy-ai/cli) on npm. Run `npx @tolstoy-ai/cli` (binary `tolstoy`) to script your Tolstoy workspace; sign in with your Tolstoy API key.
